<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND 118-2 AFTER 4TH DAY, CHASING 305.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 118-2 AFTER 4TH DAY, CHASING 305.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 118 for two wickets at the close of the fourth day on Monday in their quest for 305 to beat New Zealand in the third and final test.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 346, second innings 186.</p>
<p>England first innings 228, second innings 118 for wickets (M. Atherton 65 not out, D.Vettori 2-33).</p>
